Loom: weigh gfx1151 WMMA operand-bank ranks twice a VALU source-bank pair. With 0049's numbering trades and equal
weights, the packed (192-VGPR) afrag kres GEMMs gave up WMMA ranks for VALU pairs (IQ4_XS kres +0.5%). Weight 2 in
the matrix clauses (numbering and 0031's instruction-aware allocation): kres mean WMMA rank IQ4_XS .af.p 0.81 -> 0.68,
.af 0.75 -> 0.41, Q4_K .af 0.78 -> 0.41, IQ3 .af.p ~0.4 -> 0.2; VGPR counts unchanged, fused ffn / swiglu unchanged.
Bit-identical results; pp2048 GPU-only SQ cycles -0.2% (IQ4_XS kres -1.0%).
